OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fheavy rain spreading east during the
OL,7,Fevening. Turning drier overnight with
OL,8,Fa few light showers and clearer spells
OL,9,Flater. Gales easing, though remaining
OL,10,Fwindy at times.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FSome bright or sunny spells
OL,13,Fdeveloping during the day but these
OL,14,Finterspersed with cloudier conditions
OL,15,Fand showers, which may be heavy. Still
OL,16,Fbreezy but winds generally easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
