OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and showers early Friday but
OL,7,Fdrier and clearer later. Saturday and
OL,8,FSunday will be mostly dry with bright
OL,9,For sunny spells and light winds.
